{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgmgmXLA1NW2WXfW7PA1t","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I'm going down the page slowly, from the right.\n\n- Top: \"הראל\". Good, that's my company. \"דמי הניהול הם הממוצע שנגבה בפועל ב־2025... מנתוני רשות שוק ההון\". So it's from official figures. But who are \"מקור\"? I don't know that name.\n- \"כל המוצרים של הראל\". 105 products. Too many. Buttons: \"קופת גמל להשקעה 16\", \"קרן השתלמות 16\", \"חיסכון לכל ילד 4\"... and further \"קרנות סל 4\". I don't know that word, I skip it.\n- Then a black table full of numbers and coloured circles. This already makes me nervous.\n- The column headings at the top are small and grey. I can hardly read them.\n- \"דמי ניהול... מהחיסכון 0.54%\". That's what they take. Then \"מניות סחיר\", \"עוקב מדד S&P 500\", English letters. That's shares, not for me.\n- \"כספי (שקלי)\" shows \"3 שנים 4.25%\" and \"מניות 0%\". That sounds closest to a deposit, but I don't know if 4.25% is per year or for all three years.\n- Many rows only say \"פחות מ־3 שנים\" where the return should be. So nothing to see there.\n- Screen 4: \"עוד לא דווח\" with a small orange mark. Something's missing, I don't like it.\n- Screen 6: \"חיסכון לכל ילד\", \"דמי ניהול 0.01%\". That's for the grandchildren! Very cheap. \"חוסכים המעדיפים סיכון מוגבר 21.47%\"... risk, no.\n- \"קרן חדשה מקיפה\", \"מההפקדה 1.47%\". That's pension, I think.\n- Six screens of black and numbers. I'm tired, I'll stop here.\n\n---\n\n**What I'd tell my son:**\n\n\"Look, I didn't decide anything. I'll ask you, and then the bank. I'm not sure about any of it.\n\nI saw that Harel takes about half a percent a year 'מהחיסכון' on most of its tracks, something like 0.41% to 0.67%. On 'חיסכון לכל ילד' it's only 0.01%, which is nice for the little ones. I didn't see anything there that is a deposit or says it's safe. The closest was 'כספי (שקלי)' with 4.25% for 3 years, and I don't know if that's per year or for all three. Lots of tracks only say 'פחות מ־3 שנים', so I couldn't see how they did.\n\nWhat I looked at, in order: the heading, the product buttons, then the gemel lehashkaa table, keren hishtalmut, the 'תגמולים ואישית לפיצויים' heading, the gemel tracks, חיסכון לכל ילד, and the start of קרן חדשה מקיפה. I didn't get to the rest, 'קרן חדשה כללית', 'מרכזית לפיצויים' and 'קרנות סל'.\n\nWords I didn't understand: S&P 500, 'עוקב מדד', 'חשיפה למניות ולמט\"ח', 'מט\"ח', 'סחיר', 'גמיש', 'קרנות סל', 'קרנות מחקות', 'כסף מנוהל'. I also don't know what the coloured circles mean, or the little dotted lines under the numbers. The column headings were small and grey, hard to read even with my glasses. And the screen is all black with white and yellow numbers, which makes me anxious.\n\nWho is 'מקור'? It isn't Harel and it isn't the bank. I wouldn't do anything just because of them.\""}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":3678,"cache_read_input_tokens":11545,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":3678},"output_tokens":6,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"ae469e10-abf0-4fd5-a276-77e3180205ad","uuid":"c2b39510-39a6-4bc5-8212-06e448984535","timestamp":"2026-11-06T12:37:48.441Z","request_id":"req_011CgmgmX43HwwwmjHggCgha"}
